        "answer": {
          "short": "Even.",
          "worked": "The domain is $[-\\sqrt3,\\sqrt3]$, which is symmetric about zero.\n$$\\begin{align*}f(-x)&=\\sqrt{3-(-x)^2}\\\\f(-x)&=\\sqrt{3-x^2}\\\\f(-x)&=f(x).\\end{align*}$$\nHence $f$ is even.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 0
